# Use repo skills

This repository's workflows live in `skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.
When a request names a skill, matches a skill description, or is a
repeatable procedure this repo already ships (PR review, issue-first,
UMS, wrap-up, merge), read that skill and follow it.
Do not re-derive a procedure that already has a skill.
